mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日全量开放API</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，推出三档定价并刷新编程与安全领域性能指标</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布LiteRT.js加速库，利用WebAssembly与WebGPU实现浏览器AI推理提速3倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/06124e81b4c0aa159880ffd9eabfb1ec.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布全新Web端AI推理加速库LiteRT.js，旨在替代TensorFlow.js的传统JavaScript内核方案。该库核心采用WebAssembly技术，并深度集成WebGPU与WebNN硬件加速能力，大幅提升浏览器中机器学习工作负载的执行效率。在搭载M4芯片的2024款MacBook Pro实测中，LiteRT.js的推理速度较现有方案最高提升3倍。此次架构升级标志着谷歌推动Web端AI推理从纯JavaScript向高性能硬件加速阶段演进，使浏览器端运行AI模型的性能逼近原生应用水平。该技术不仅优化了客户端AI的部署体验，也为无需安装插件即可实现流畅AI交互提供了技术支撑，对端侧AI的普及具有重要意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯拟接盘AI初创公司Manus成最大股东，估值达20亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97ef792120e26c5284778ab38c44f9d0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯控股正洽谈成为新加坡AI初创公司Manus的最大股东，计划以20亿美元估值接盘此前被Meta撤销的收购案。该交易涉及腾讯、真格基金、红杉中国及管理层，腾讯预计将认购最多股份，而Benchmark等美国风投机构或将退出。Manus成立于2022年，由肖弘、季逸超和张涛创立，专注于AI Agent领域，目前年度经常性收入（ARR）已接近5亿美元。交易完成后，Manus将保持独立运营，并计划在香港上市。此次增持将加速腾讯微信嵌入式AI智能体的应用落地，深化其在AGI时代的底层生态布局。此前，Manus创始人肖弘已受邀参与腾讯微信AI智能体的测试，双方在技术与业务层面已有深度协同。Manus未来将进行重组以满足中国监管要求，在脱离Meta生态后继续保持独立增长。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日全量开放API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8a99773646ec407ef9c7515421df4da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动旗下视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日正式全量开放API，标志着该模型从灰度测试阶段迈向全面商用。Seedance2.5于6月23日发布，目前字节旗下AI创作平台“即梦”已开启上线预热，并计划配套推出会员折扣与积分优惠。技术层面，该模型实现三大突破：支持30秒单段原生视频直出，大幅提升连贯性；参考素材容量提升至最高50个全模态素材，增强复杂场景理解；引入更具可控性的视频编辑功能，支持对画面主体和运镜的精准微调。行业预计其定价将与2.0版本持平。此次全量商用将进一步降低高品质视频生成门槛，加速AI视频工具在影视创意及商业广告领域的工程化落地进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，推出三档定价并刷新编程与安全领域性能指标</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c493c4636b6ed89435c6afaf53b4e36.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式向全球全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，包含旗舰版Sol、均衡版Terra及性价比版Luna，并于24小时内覆盖ChatGPT、Codex及API。定价策略极具竞争力，最低档Luna每百万Token输入/输出仅需1/6美元，约为Anthropic旗舰模型Fable5价格的十六分之一。性能方面，Sol在Agents&#x27; Last Exam评测中以53.6分超越Fable5，并在编程智能体指数中以80分刷新纪录。此外，GPT-5.6引入ultra模式支持16个智能体并行，在BrowseComp测试中以92.2%刷新纪录，ExploitBench得分提升至73.5%。尽管在SWE-Bench Pro及FrontierMath等深度工程与前沿数学领域仍落后于Fable5，但其高性价比策略显著改变了行业竞争格</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab4da36137c14965b56ec16876692b7a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta 正式发布旗舰大模型 Muse Spark 1.1，重点优化多代理自动化工作流程，现已通过 Meta AI 及 API 开启公众预览。该模型支持 100 万标记的上下文窗口，并引入上下文压缩机制，能有效保存关键细节以实现子任务间的数据传递，解决长流程任务中的信息丢失问题。在性能表现上，Muse Spark 1.1 在 Vibe Code Bench v1.1 基准测试中取得 72.2 分，较前代提升超 50 分，在 SWE-Atlas Codebase QnA 测试中得分提升近 18%。该模型具备强大的多步骤任务处理能力，如自动修复代码、生成电商描述及执行订单等。Meta 计划明年将数据中心容量提升至 14 千兆瓦，并有望推出自研 AI 芯片 Iris。此次更新显著增强了模型在复杂编码与自动化任务中的逻</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
